  "definition": "Renewal Requirements",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-04-07",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Soil 400) #9886-A, eff 3-11-11, EXPIRED: 3-11-19 New. #13560, eff 4-7-23 (formerly Soil 403.01)",
